+
+        # jetcentral1..N: pt-leading CentralJetsGood as indexed columns, exactly
+        # mirroring the jet{i}/fatjet{i}/lepton{i} pattern above. The bdt_nov13
+        # classifiers take jetcentral1..4_btagDeepFlavQG as input features, and
